                        is not associated with a character special device.

     [EINVAL]           The _w argument to ttccsseettwwiinnssiizzee() is not valid.

     [EFAULT]           The _w argument to ttccggeettwwiinnssiizzee() or to ttccsseettwwiinnssiizzee()
                        points outside the process's allocated address space.

